{"id":"vod_md_3002","vodId":"3002","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"关于完全听不懂老公在说什么的事第一季","name_cn":"关于完全听不懂老公在说什么的事第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230822-1/0bf8d64df750c1fe9ac5d78bad90808e.jpg"},"summary":"佐村薰炭（田村由香里 配音）是一位平凡的公司职员，每日过着朝九晚五的规律生活，日子平静又安宁。可是，这样一个普通的女人，他的老公十一（铃村健一 配音）却是个彻头彻尾的“宅男”。对漫画、动画和网络极为熟悉和热衷的十一，配上对此一窍不通但温柔的包容着老公的佐村薰炭，会有怎样有趣的故事发生在这对夫妻之间呢？看似十分年轻但早已经嫁为人妻的树濑理乃（钉宫理惠 配音）、理乃的老公，职业拳击手树濑旺（坂井俊文 配音）、沉着冷静的小镇医生田中（新谷良子 配音）、田中的老公山田（外崎大辅 配音），在佐村薰炭和十一的周围，围绕着的是性格各异但都同样善良有趣的好友们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-22 07:46:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/blmimyOM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/OLEmYaHR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/yPA8whwu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/rCcV2lGM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/32TooNj1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/1muHBVOx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/0Hki7V9Q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/UYqZX4lh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/23lQ8NC6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/6mlCSkAc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/VksCj1uG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/ExR6rJ9a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/I3HWEMRt/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:51.296Z"}